   "notes": "Joint BM3-Mie-Gruneisen-Debye fit for pure cubic Pm-3m CaSiO3 using model 1 in Table 2. The fitted data cover approximately 21-156 GPa and 1200-2600 K (the lowest Table 1 state is 21.2 GPa; the study reports measurements up to 156 GPa). The 300 K V0, K0, and K0' define an extrapolated reference isotherm: cubic CaSiO3 is not quenchable and the record must not be interpreted as a stable cubic phase at 300 K. The paper does not publish parameter covariance or a confidence convention for the parenthetical errors.",
